entries.userPrompt:
Pitch black room, boudoir-style photograph captured on a digital camera from a low angle. A single overhead light source illuminates the scene, creating strong shadows and dramatic contrast. The environment around them is completely dark, with only the light revealing their forms.

Three women lean over the camera so that their stomachs and torsos are closest to the lens, creating a dramatic perspective as they look down toward the camera.

@jess is the woman on the left, leaning forward toward the camera with her shoulders angled slightly inward toward the group. The overhead light hits only one side of her face, leaving the other half in shadow while she looks down toward the lens with a calm, confident expression. wearing white bra and underwear
@riley is the woman in the middle, leaning slightly closer to the camera than the others so her torso is closest to the lens. The single light source highlights one side of her cheekbones and jawline while the other half of her face fades into darkness. She looks down toward the camera with a relaxed, poised expression. wearing grey bra and underwear
@alba  the woman on the right, leaning forward with one arm slightly raised near her head while looking down toward the camera. The single light source illuminates half of her face while the other side disappears into shadow, creating a dramatic cinematic effect. wearing black bra and underwear

The three women stand very close together, forming a tight triangular composition above the camera.

